    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Byrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 14 The Grove, Curragh Grange to the market for sale. This is a spacious four-bedroom semi-detached family home. Curragh Grange is a modern and well-established residential development of semi-detached and detached homes, ideally located just off the Green Road and Athgarvan Road, within easy walking distance of Newbridge town centre.\n\nSituated at the end of the row in a quiet cul-de-sac No. 14 offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal home for families looking for space, convenience and a well-connected location.\n\nOn entering, a lovely entrance porch leads into a bright hallway with timber flooring. To the left is the garage area, providing useful additional storage space. The spacious sitting room is filled with natural light and features timber flooring and an open fireplace, creating a comfortable space for everyday family living.\nDouble doors lead through to the large kitchen and dining area. The kitchen offers a good selection of storage units and generous worktop space, with tiled flooring, while the adjoining dining area features timber flooring and sliding doors providing direct access to the rear garden. Outside, the garden offers a good balance of patio and lawn, providing a practical space for outdoor dining, family get-togethers and for children to enjoy. A separate utility room, downstairs WC and side entrance add further practicality to the accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, all with carpet flooring. The main bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobes and a private ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms also offer built-in wardrobe storage. A spacious family bathroom completes the first floor.\n\nThe location is a major attraction, with a range of everyday amenities available within easy walking distance. Curragh Grange neighbourhood shopping centre provides a convenience store, pharmacy, hairdressers and other local services, while the Curragh Plains are approximately a 15-minute walk away. Whitewater Shopping Centre, with its extensive range of shops, restaurants, leisure facilities and cinema, is also within approximately a 10-minute walk.\n\nNewbridge is particularly well served by a wide selection of primary and secondary schools, sports clubs, recreational facilities and transport links, making it a popular choice for families.\nNo. 14 The Grove offers generous accommodation in a convenient and established location and would make a lovely family home. Early viewing is recommended to appreciate the space and location this property has to offer.\n\n\nServices \nMinutes From Town Centre\nFreshly painted throughout\nSought After Location\nClose to schools and shops\n"
